@baseUrl = http://localhost:8083
@jobId = replace-with-id-from-post-response

### Complete recurring example: call now, then again after 10 seconds
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/examples/heartbeat

### Student task: accept a one-time job (expect 202)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{"upperBound":10,"delaySeconds":5}

### Complete GET endpoint: check state (copy id from POST into @jobId)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{jobId}}

### Invalid input (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{"upperBound":0,"delaySeconds":0}

### Missing job (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
